sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Manager/Specialist
    participant UI as Leads UI
    participant API as Leads API
    participant Auth as JWT/RBAC
    participant Lead as Lead Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant Sync as Sync Engine
    participant Audit as Audit Service

    User->>UI: Chọn "Chuyển → Won"
    UI->>API: POST /opportunities/{id}/convert
    API->>Auth: Kiểm tra quyền
    Auth-->>API: Cho phép
    API->>Lead: convertToWon(id, closedDate)
    Lead->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION + lock Opportunity
    DB-->>Lead: Opportunity hiện tại
    alt Không tồn tại hoặc đã chuyển
      Lead->>DB: ROLLBACK
      Lead-->>API: 404/409
      API-->>UI: Hiển thị lỗi
    else Hợp lệ
      Lead->>DB: Tạo ClosedDeal từ snapshot OPP
      Lead->>DB: Đánh dấu Opportunity = WON
      Lead->>DB: Cập nhật weekly KPI/value liên quan
      Lead->>Audit: Ghi conversion event
      Lead->>DB: COMMIT
      Lead->>Sync: Recalculate dashboard/expense views
      Lead-->>API: ClosedDeal DTO
      API-->>UI: 201 Created
      UI-->>User: Pipeline giảm, Won tăng
    end

